## Among the Roses

@narrator: The garden is quiet in the {{run.slot}} light, except for a magpie on the sundial.
@pippa{mono}: Magpies love anything that shines.
@pippa{mono when="run.sawPocket"}: Not a hymn book in the vicar's pocket, then. Something shinier?

<branch id="accuse" prompt="Who took the Hollin spoon?">
  <choice id="accuseCook" label="Mrs. Dunn, the cook" into="run.accused" value="cook">
    @pippa: Mrs. Dunn, you washed five spoons, not six.
  </choice>
  <choice id="accuseVicar" label="The vicar" into="run.accused" value="vicar">
    @pippa: Vicar, turn out your pocket.
  </choice>
  <choice id="accuseMagpie" label="The magpie" into="run.accused" value="magpie" when="run.cluesFound >= 2">
    @pippa: It was never a person at all.
  </choice>
</branch>
